AppleSkin for Horizon

This repository adapts AppleSkin-Horizon by @soufied:
https://github.com/soufied/AppleSkin-Horizon
Base commit: 20180ee8c7606d4cdc139211a02ca587ae2710fd
The MIT license and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.

It is based on AppleSkin by squeek502:
https://github.com/squeek502/AppleSkin
AppleSkin is dedicated to the public domain under the Unlicense;
its notice is preserved in LICENSE-APPLESKIN.

Local changes: named Horizon hooks, live main/off-hand food selection,
edibility checks, an off-hand setting, deterministic packaging, and CI.
This project is not an official AppleSkin or Horizon release.
